    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that \"agitated whirlwind\" description is helpful, but it still feels very chaotic. when i'm doing it, the noise doesn't feel like a single event, it feels almost like there's a bunch of tiny, frantic little things happening inside my mouth to make that friction. is there a way to describe that \"unsettled\" or \"scurrying\" feeling of the air in a more technical way?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
